WEBVTT

00:33:57.577 --> 00:34:01.409
In the meantime, I'm just here holding
space for you while you're in agony."

00:34:01.433 --> 00:34:06.908
So what I don't like about
what I think of as "art-school suffering,"

00:34:06.932 --> 00:34:10.245
which is sort of a goth commitment to:

00:34:10.269 --> 00:34:13.005
"the only way I'm going to be
taken seriously as an artist

00:34:13.029 --> 00:34:14.307
is if I follow the pain,"

00:34:14.331 --> 00:34:16.891
is that you're excluding
half of the human experience,

00:34:16.915 --> 00:34:18.951
because a good deal
of the human experience

00:34:18.975 --> 00:34:21.999
is pain and suffering and darkness,
but it's not the full story.

00:34:22.023 --> 00:34:26.364
There's also incredible love, resilience,
beauty and grace within that as well,

00:34:26.388 --> 00:34:29.018
and if you don't tell both
of those pieces of the story,

00:34:29.042 --> 00:34:31.437
then you're not telling the full story.